## Design / UI Source of Truth

The 2026-08-30 **house** restyle is the visual source of truth for Home (`/`), Browse (`/events`), Auth, and participant product pages. Public event detail (`/events/:id`) is a **cover-photo conference**: shared `PublicSiteHeader` above the banner island, countdown and Register over a dark gradient, Pulse black facts bar, white-card two-column body (about / why-attend / speakers / agenda left; register + Event Detail + organizer + partners right; full-width gallery below). It does **not** inherit house chrome except the shared `SiteFooter` at the bottom. Organizer remains an ops console. Written tokens live in `design/MASTER.md`; page overrides in `design-system/pages/landing.md`, `browse-events.md`, `participant.md`, and `event-detail.md`. Event-detail palette: `src/components/event-public/pulseTheme.ts`.

Locked system:

- House accent: emerald only (`160 72% 34%`). Cool zinc neutrals on white. Not inspiration blue, not Pulse teal on Home/Browse, not rose, not cream, not orange, not acid `#00FF00`.
- Public discovery + participant concept: **the house**. Slim masthead (`PublicSiteHeader` default), `.house-page` follows `html.dark`, rounded photography cards, admission-stub motif. Night lineup (ink bed, `tone="lineup"`, Barlow Condensed, 3:4 posters, title marquee) is retired on these surfaces.
- Event detail is a **cover-photo conference**: shared `PublicSiteHeader` above the cover island, countdown, overlapping black facts bar, white-card two-column body, full-width gallery grid. No `EventPulseHeader` on the photo. Catalog cards are house cards; the detail hero is the event cover, not a catalog card.
- Purchased stubs are **light perforated Event24 passes** (serial `E24-xxxxx`, QR when valid). Not dark laminate.
- Organizer concept: **org console** (warm paper canvas `#FCFAF7`, teal brand `#0F6E56`, amber accent `#E8A33D`, ink `#141B17`, danger `#C2452D`). Chrome is a **single persistent topbar**, not a sidebar (sidebar removed 2026-09-01 in the anti-slop redesign; see review canvas `canvases/organizer-portal-review.canvas.tsx`). Desktop chrome = `OrgTopbar`: sticky top-0 bar, logo + wordmark, underline nav (Dashboard/Events/Check-in/Finance), `AccountMenu` (workspace + email, Settings, Log out). Search, Bell, New event, and Public site are **not** in the topbar — Create stays on the Events page. Mobile = `OrgAppBar` + `OrgBottomNav` (4 items, `text-[11px]` labels; no Home / Bell). Dashboard `<main>` is `max-w-[1200px]`; studio is `max-w-[1280px]`. `/organizer/scanner` **keeps the topbar** (not immersive); unlock is a centered `max-w-md` card. Event Studio is the **only** left rail: `OrgStudioNav` (232px, 12px items, EVENT/PEOPLE/MANAGE, All events + identity) plus slim `OrgStudioHeader` actions; desktop studio is document flow with a sticky rail (`top-16`) and native page scroll. `SmoothScroll` / Lenis is skipped on `/organizer`. Dashboard Recent events is a hairline table, not thumb-rows. Overview is **edit-only** (`EventQuickInfo` + gallery). Type: H1 `text-[22px] lg:text-2xl`, `OrgStatCard` `text-[22px] lg:text-[26px]`, event titles `text-base`, `OrgButton` md `py-2.5 text-[13px]`. Thumbs teal/amber/slate only. Analytics stays routed, not in nav. Dark console remaps `--oc-*` under `.dark .org-console`; theme toggle lives on the topbar.
- Console tokens live in `src/index.css` under `.org-console` (`--oc-*` HSL vars; shadcn `--primary`/`--card`/`--muted`… remapped onto them so existing panels adopt the palette). Console radii normalized: `.rounded-xl`→16px, `.rounded-md`→12px inside `.org-console`. Shared primitives in `src/components/organizer-console/`: `OrgButton` (primary/ghost/dark/danger), `OrgChip` (brand/plain/faint/amber/bad dot chips), `OrgStatCard`, `orgTheme.ts` (status tones, money format, thumb gradients, initials).
- Console type: Funnel Sans Variable (`font-head`, headings), Inter Variable (body), IBM Plex Mono (`font-data`, tokens/amounts/serials). House pages keep Outfit Variable + Source Sans 3 Variable + JetBrains Mono. Self-hosted via `@fontsource*`.
- Icons: organizer console uses Heroicons 2 outline (`react-icons/hi2`) through `src/components/organizer-console/orgIcons.ts`. Lucide stays for spinners (`Loader2`) and for house/shadcn primitives. Do not mix lucide glyphs into organizer chrome or studio panels.
- Motion: framer-motion, honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Console screens are motion-light (dial 2). `SmoothScroll` mounts Lenis on public/participant routes only — never on `/organizer`.
- Dual theme via `next-themes` (`storageKey` `app-theme`, default `system`). House pages (`.house-page`) and the org console (`.org-console`) follow `html.dark`. Public event detail (`.pulse-event`) follows `html.dark` with Pulse teal primary. QR pads stay white so codes scan. `Logo` uses `logo_dark_url` when the resolved theme is dark.
- Public discovery dials: Home/Browse variance 6, motion 5, density 4. Event detail cover-photo conference: variance 7, motion 6, density 4. Participant product: variance 4, motion 3, density 6. Organizer product: variance 3, motion 2, density 7.

CTA lock (one label per intent): Home · Browse events · Register · Rooms · My Tickets · Create event · Organizer.

Public event detail (`/events/:id`) is a cover-photo conference on warm paper. It does not use `.house-page`, `.lineup-page`, or `font-lineup`. Hero is the event banner in a rounded island with type at the bottom-left. Chrome accent is Pulse teal `#2ECFC2`. Override spec: `design-system/pages/event-detail.md`. Registration stays on this page (no separate checkout route).

