Confirmation page (`/registrations/:id`) no longer forces light `#F8FAFC` ink on the page (which made outline buttons unreadable on dark cards). Status on `PurchasedTicketStub` renders as a proper pill with dark-mode-safe `statusMeta` classes. Checkout stepper inactive steps use `text-muted-foreground` instead of white-on-muted.

