### 2026-09-03 — Waafi checkout: poll participation after phone approval

`ParticipantWaafiPayment` now polls `GET /participant/participations/{id}` every 4s while the charging spinner is visible. If the user approves EVC on their phone before the long-running charge HTTP returns (or if charge returns `pending`/times out), checkout still advances to confirmation when `payment_status` becomes `paid`. Pending charge responses no longer show a false failure. **Check status** is available during charging and after errors.

