Door scanner (camera + manual token) rejects tickets for ended events. Laravel validates `completed`/`cancelled` or past `ends_at` before `already_used`. Unlock also blocked. `CheckInScanner` shows “This event has ended. Check-in is closed.”

### 2026-09-05 — Hide door QR after check-in or event end

`PurchasedTicketStub` / PNG download omit the QR + token panel when participation `status === checked_in`, event `status === completed`, or `ends_at` is in the past (`ticketShowsDoorCode`). Wired from My Tickets and registration detail.

### 2026-09-03 — Short door QR tokens (one line)

Laravel `QrTokenService` now issues **8-character** uppercase door codes (alphabet without 0/O/1/I/L) instead of 64-char hex. Same value is encoded in the QR and shown under it for manual entry. Migration `2026_09_03_150000_shorten_participation_qr_tokens` rewrites legacy long tokens. Scan lookup normalizes case.

### 2026-09-03 — QR token under the ticket QR

On `PurchasedTicketStub` and the downloaded PNG, the text under the QR is the participation `qr_token` (not “Door chip”), so door staff can scan the code or type the token into manual check-in.

