`Download ticket` on `/registrations/:id` saves `event24-pass-E24-#####.png` — landscape Event24 stub only (admit one, date/door/type chips, QR + token). No print dialog, no PDF page chrome. Renderer: `src/lib/ticketImage.ts`.

### 2026-09-03 — Static ticket only (remove invitation templates)

All attendees get the same Event24 pass stub (`PurchasedTicketStub`). Download saves a PNG of that stub. Organizer Invitation designer tab removed (`/branding` and `/invitation` redirect to overview). Laravel dropped `event_invitation_templates` + `invitation_system_templates`; organizer/admin template APIs gone. `GET /participant/participations/{id}/invitation` still returns ticket payload with `invitation: null` and `qr_token` for in-person door scan.

