### 2026-09-03 — Admin Form Fields tab + `event_form_fields` table gone

The Admin screenshot still showed Form Fields because `public/build` was stale. Laravel Event hub `EVENT_TABS` has no Form Fields entry. Table `event_form_fields` is dropped. Leftover form-field PHP deleted. Web studio form files were already gone; `/form` still redirects to tickets.

### 2026-09-03 — No waitlist; failed payment releases the seat

Waitlist removed end-to-end. Full events return 400 `Event capacity reached` (no promote routes). Confirmed capacity (`registrations_count`) is free joined + paid + checked-in only. Unpaid pending still **holds** a seat for 15 minutes so checkout cannot oversell; Waafi failure, pending expiry, or abandoned unpaid checkout **cancels** the participation and releases ticket quantity. Laravel migration cancels leftover waitlisted/failed-active rows. Web: no waitlist screens, no Promote; failed payment ticket page offers Register again.

