**Laravel API:** removed public `GET /events/{id}/form-fields`, organizer form-field routes, admin `/event-form-fields` route group. `ParticipationService::join()` ignores custom answers (always stores `null`). Controllers no longer accept `custom_field_answers` on join.

**Laravel Admin SPA:** removed Form Fields tab (`FormFieldOversight.tsx` deleted); cleaned `event.ts` + types.

