### 2026-08-20 — Fix invitation Download PDF print layout

`Download PDF` on `/registrations/:id` was broken: print moved the live `#invitation-canvas` out of `InvitationScaled` then restored it immediately after `window.print()` (Chrome often returns while the dialog is still open), and Letter margins clipped the bottom of the 800×1100 sheet where the QR sits. Fix in `RegistrationDetail.tsx`: clone a `.invitation-print-sheet` into `#print-root`, wait for `afterprint` to clear it, inject `@page` size ≈ 8.333×11.458in with zero margins, scale with `min(100vw/800, 100vh/1100)`, and `print-color-adjust: exact` so background + QR images paint. Blocks print if `qr_token` exists but QR data URL is still loading.

